From d3930c77752f02b547ac04e6cc55ea2e4011e2ff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 14:51:54 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] feat(tools): import and export PathPilot CSV and Hurco
 TCM tables

Add clean-room machine tool-table codecs in camcraft-tools for Tormach PathPilot
(.csv) and Hurco WinMax (.TCM), extend ImportTools to preserve controller T<n>
numbers with clash checks and single-undo swaps, expose format/units options in
the UI, MCP, and script verbs, and document the workflows in the guide.

Fixes #2566
